---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { href, channels } from '../data/site';
---

<Base title="About Carl & the community">
  <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <a href={href()}>Home</a> / About
  </nav>
  <article class="article-wrap" style="margin-top:40px;margin-bottom:55px">
    <span class="eyebrow">The story behind the community</span>
    <h1>
      Australian beginnings.
      <br />
      Croatian roots.
    </h1>
    <p style="font-size:21px">
      Croatian By Descent Community is created by Carl Tomich, an
      Australian-born creator with Croatian heritage who recently became a
      Croatian citizen.
    </p>
    <figure class="article-image">
      <img
        src={href('images/coast.webp')}
        alt="Rooftops of Zadar overlooking the Adriatic Sea"
        width="1440"
        height="960"
      />
      <figcaption>
        Zadar, Croatia. <a href={href('image-credits/')}>Image credits</a>.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>A personal journey, a shared resource</h2>
      <p>
        Carl is documenting life, ancestry, relocation and his experiences in
        Croatia. This platform brings those interests together in a space for
        useful information and human stories.
      </p>
      <p>
        The aim is to help people explore their connection to Croatia, whether
        they are planning a move, researching family history, considering
        citizenship by descent or simply curious about everyday life.
      </p>
      <h2>Room for the full picture</h2>
      <p>
        We want the good experiences and the difficult ones to have a place
        here. Personal stories will be clearly distinguished from professional
        advice and official information. Initial sample guides and templates are
        labelled while the editorial library develops.
      </p>
      <h2>Explore Carl’s work</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a href="https://carltravels.com/">Carl Travels</a>
        </li>
        {channels.map((c) => (
          <li>
            <a href={c.url}>{c.name} on YouTube</a>
          </li>
        ))}
        <li>
          <a href="https://croatianbydescent.com/">Croatian By Descent</a>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Have a Croatian chapter to share?</h2>
      <p>
        We welcome proposals for diaspora stories, returnee conversations and
        practical local perspectives.{' '}
        <a href={href('contact/')}>Contact & community submissions</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
